00:56:09.000 --> 00:56:28.930
<v Ira Glass>[ACKNOWLEDGMENTS]
<v Ira Glass>[鸣谢]

00:56:28.930 --> 00:56:43.880
<v Ira Glass>Our show was produced for the stage by Kate Boyd and the Solo Mio Festival. Addition music by David Riera. WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia. I'm Ira Glass. It has been such a thrill being here. Back next week with more stores of This American Life.
